      "content": "idk i dont think noticing patterns in the street is gonna help me feel less invisible. it just feels like i'm watching life happen from the outside. like there's this huge gap between me and everyone else and it's just getting wider. honestly sometimes it feels like the world would just keep spinning exactly the same way if i just... stopped trying so hard to be part of it. like maybe it would be easier to just let go of the struggle entirely.",
